mc(4, `evidence`, `Consider these statements. (i) Homologous organs show divergence. (ii) Analogous organs show convergence. (iii) Vestigial organs are always useless. (iv) Fossils are mostly found in igneous rocks. How many are correct?`, `Two`, [`One`, `Three`, `Four`], `(i) and (ii) are correct. (iii) is wrong because vestigial organs may have minor functions. (iv) is wrong because fossils are in sedimentary rocks.`, `The word "always" is a common trap.`, `statements`);
