mc(4, `human evolution`, `Consider: (i) Homo habilis had a brain of 650 to 800 cc. (ii) Homo erectus ate meat. (iii) Neanderthals lived about 15 million years ago. (iv) Australopithecus was found in Ethiopia and Tanzania. How many are correct?`, `Three`, [`Two`, `Four`, `One`], `(i), (ii) and (iv) are correct. (iii) is wrong, as the Neanderthals are far younger (around a few lakh years).`, ``, `statements`);

